tsrs-only: makes Checker::get_members_of_symbol and Checker::get_signatures_of_symbol public and re-exports
get_declaration_modifier_flags_from_symbol from tsrs_checker. The effect-tsgo Go shim exposes the two unexported
methods through extra-shim.json (checker.Checker_getMembersOfSymbol, checker.Checker_getSignaturesOfSymbol), and
GetDeclarationModifierFlagsFromSymbol is exported by typescript-go's checker package; the API-stability analysis
(internal/typeparser/api_stability.go) reads a symbol's late-bound member table, a signature member's raw signatures
and a member's declaration modifier flags through them. Visibility only, no behavior change.

